view/pr-58/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority",{"_94":130},"platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority.mdx",{"_69":132,"_76":87,"_71":133,"_81":134,"_90":-7,"_10":135,"_92":136},"es:platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx","Emite y verifica un certificado","Emite un certificado de cliente y comprueba contenido, cadena y correspondencia de clave.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate",{"_94":137},"platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx",{"_69":139,"_76":115,"_90":-7,"_71":140},"es:_1","Conceptos",{"_69":142,"_76":87,"_71":143,"_81":144,"_90":-7,"_10":145,"_92":146},"es:platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx","Modelo de confianza","Entiende dónde nace la confianza, cómo se distribuye y qué valida cada componente.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model",{"_94":147},"platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx",{"_69":149,"_76":87,"_71":150,"_81":151,"_90":-7,"_10":152,"_92":153},"es:platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx","Ciclo de vida de un certificado","Emisión, uso, renovación, revocación y retirada de certificados en Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle",{"_94":154},"platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx",{"_69":156,"_76":115,"_90":-7,"_71":157},"es:_2","Claves, autoridades y certificados",{"_69":159,"_76":87,"_71":160,"_81":161,"_90":-7,"_10":162,"_92":163},"es:platform/pki/key-management.mdx","Claves y motores criptográficos","Genera, importa y opera claves sin acoplar la PKI a un proveedor concreto.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/key-management",{"_94":164},"platform/pki/key-management.mdx",{"_69":166,"_76":87,"_71":167,"_81":168,"_90":-7,"_10":169,"_92":170},"es:platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx","Autoridades","Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities",{"_94":171},"platform/pki/certifica